.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Six commercial textbooks live here. They belong on the disk, not in the
# history: 41MB of a 56MB repo, and git keeps them for ever even after a
# later delete. Nothing in the decks reads from this folder at build time.
materials/

# LaTeX intermediates left behind when a beamer render fails. Quarto
# deletes these on a clean run; a crashed run leaves them beside the .qmd,
# where they get mistaken for source. The .pdf is the only build output
# worth keeping in the repo.
**/*.tex
!_shared/*.tex
!_extensions/**/*.tex
**/*.aux
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.nav
**/*.snm
**/*.vrb
